    <operation name="PUT_setColorPhotos">
      <documentation>Saves which photo shows each colour, and nothing else about the shop. Only colours already saved in the shop's options change; `null` clears a colour's photo. A photo id that isn't one of the shop's photos is ignored.</documentation>
      <input message="wsdl:PUT_setColorPhotos_InputMessage" />
