      <documentation>Everything an AI shopping agent needs to describe the product and decide to buy it: price, shipping, delivery, availability, options, images and FAQ. Public. Buying goes through the MCP server named in `mcp_server`, or the `order_url` links. Shop pages also carry the same facts as schema.org `Product` JSON-LD. A person clicking the link in a browser (`Sec-Fetch-User: ?1`) is redirected instead; known assistants and headless browsers always get JSON. It goes to the shop page, unless the link has `?view=json`.</documentation>
